{"title":"The Facebook Boomer reactor core","link":"https://www.usermag.co/p/the-facebook-boomer-reactor-core","date":1749914245000,"content":"<div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TYil!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd663665e-46d3-4254-a987-7ff3231ee2f0_1200x649.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TYil!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd663665e-46d3-4254-a987-7ff3231ee2f0_1200x649.png\" width=\"1200\" height=\"649\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TYil!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd663665e-46d3-4254-a987-7ff3231ee2f0_1200x649.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TYil!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd663665e-46d3-4254-a987-7ff3231ee2f0_1200x649.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TYil!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd663665e-46d3-4254-a987-7ff3231ee2f0_1200x649.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TYil!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd663665e-46d3-4254-a987-7ff3231ee2f0_1200x649.png 1456w\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Meta’s new <a href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/mark-zuckerberg-meta-ai-chatbot-discover-feed-depressing-why-2025-6\">A.I. Discover feed</a> is broadcasting strangers’ most intimate chats, including grief, custody battles, and accidental data leaks, to anyone scrolling.</p><div></div><p>Back in April, Meta launched a stand alone A.I. app called <a href=\"https://www.meta.ai/\">Meta A.I.</a> While the app looks exactly like ChatGPT, it’s targeted towards more casual A.I. users. Meta A.I. is not designed to handle large data sets or writing code. Instead, the company has encouraged users to chat with it for basic life questions and integrate it into their daily lives. </p><p>What many people don’t realize, however, is that their questions and image generation prompts may be inadvertently shared to a <a href=\"https://www.meta.ai/\">massive public Meta A.I. “discover” feed</a>. Meta spokesman Daniel Roberts told <em>Business Insider</em> that there's a multi-step process to sharing a chat history or image to Meta AI's Discovery feed, but many public posts appear to contain highly personal and sensitive information. </p><p><a href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/mark-zuckerberg\">Mark Zuckerberg</a> has said that A.I. is core to his company’s future success. He just made a massive investment in ScaleAI and hired its CEO to run a project within Meta aimed at creating a <a href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/ai-talent-wars-recruiting-hiring-white-hot-2025-6\">superintelligence</a> that's smarter than a human. Business Insider’s Katie Notopolous noted that Meta A.I. chat logs revealed personal info like a user’s phone number and email address when they asked for help drafting a letter to a judge in a child custody case.</p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kXvP!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F90c6dab0-39fb-4b68-9bd7-51d2cf96d7e8_944x946.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kXvP!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F90c6dab0-39fb-4b68-9bd7-51d2cf96d7e8_944x946.png\" width=\"424\" height=\"424.89830508474574\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kXvP!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F90c6dab0-39fb-4b68-9bd7-51d2cf96d7e8_944x946.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kXvP!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F90c6dab0-39fb-4b68-9bd7-51d2cf96d7e8_944x946.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kXvP!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F90c6dab0-39fb-4b68-9bd7-51d2cf96d7e8_944x946.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kXvP!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F90c6dab0-39fb-4b68-9bd7-51d2cf96d7e8_944x946.png 1456w\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>“Did that person mean to share that information with the world? Maybe, but I'm guessing they might have clicked the wrong button and didn't realize what they were doing,” Notopolous <a href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/mark-zuckerberg-meta-ai-chatbot-discover-feed-depressing-why-2025-6\">writes</a>. Other conversations <a href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/mark-zuckerberg-meta-ai-chatbot-discover-feed-depressing-why-2025-6\">she saw</a> included someone asking the AI to send them a reminder at the end of the month to cancel their Experian credit-monitoring subscription and a woman asking for help writing a letter to her local Elks Lodge after she said she'd been suspended for an altercation she had with another member.</p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e4kf!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fec290af8-8376-4ea1-9a68-df437dbaa5f2_725x1199.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e4kf!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fec290af8-8376-4ea1-9a68-df437dbaa5f2_725x1199.jpeg\" width=\"439\" height=\"726.0151724137932\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e4kf!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fec290af8-8376-4ea1-9a68-df437dbaa5f2_725x1199.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e4kf!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fec290af8-8376-4ea1-9a68-df437dbaa5f2_725x1199.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e4kf!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fec290af8-8376-4ea1-9a68-df437dbaa5f2_725x1199.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e4kf!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fec290af8-8376-4ea1-9a68-df437dbaa5f2_725x1199.jpeg 1456w\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>The Discover feed has become a fascinating peek into the collective consciousness of Meta’s most engaged user base. “If you ever wanted to stare directly into the Facebook Boomer reactor core, now you can,” one X user <a href=\"https://x.com/elaifresh/status/1933168804663898133\">posted</a>. It reveals how and why many average Americans are actually using A.I. A lot of content on the feed is benign, but some questions users are asking the chatbot are deeply personal and disturbing. Scrolling through the feed ultimately made me feel sad about how lonely many Americans lives are, especially older Americans. </p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KuBV!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff3560874-3413-4511-ae46-81b82fa3262e_464x680.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KuBV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff3560874-3413-4511-ae46-81b82fa3262e_464x680.jpeg\" width=\"336\" height=\"492.41379310344826\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KuBV!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff3560874-3413-4511-ae46-81b82fa3262e_464x680.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KuBV!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff3560874-3413-4511-ae46-81b82fa3262e_464x680.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KuBV!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff3560874-3413-4511-ae46-81b82fa3262e_464x680.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KuBV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff3560874-3413-4511-ae46-81b82fa3262e_464x680.jpeg 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!SC56!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa1f0e0eb-515d-4efb-9af9-973e86e60957_532x900.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!SC56!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa1f0e0eb-515d-4efb-9af9-973e86e60957_532x900.jpeg\" width=\"322\" height=\"544.7368421052631\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!SC56!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa1f0e0eb-515d-4efb-9af9-973e86e60957_532x900.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!SC56!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa1f0e0eb-515d-4efb-9af9-973e86e60957_532x900.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!SC56!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa1f0e0eb-515d-4efb-9af9-973e86e60957_532x900.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!SC56!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa1f0e0eb-515d-4efb-9af9-973e86e60957_532x900.jpeg 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Biog!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc6086610-82c5-491e-a48a-17483d694d9a_566x680.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Biog!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc6086610-82c5-491e-a48a-17483d694d9a_566x680.jpeg\" width=\"364\" height=\"437.3144876325088\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Biog!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc6086610-82c5-491e-a48a-17483d694d9a_566x680.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Biog!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc6086610-82c5-491e-a48a-17483d694d9a_566x680.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Biog!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc6086610-82c5-491e-a48a-17483d694d9a_566x680.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Biog!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc6086610-82c5-491e-a48a-17483d694d9a_566x680.jpeg 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mCHw!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb2191959-28c4-4023-8ad2-628552389ea7_938x1552.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mCHw!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb2191959-28c4-4023-8ad2-628552389ea7_938x1552.png\" width=\"373\" height=\"617.1599147121535\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mCHw!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb2191959-28c4-4023-8ad2-628552389ea7_938x1552.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mCHw!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb2191959-28c4-4023-8ad2-628552389ea7_938x1552.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mCHw!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb2191959-28c4-4023-8ad2-628552389ea7_938x1552.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mCHw!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb2191959-28c4-4023-8ad2-628552389ea7_938x1552.png 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>These Meta A.I. chat logs were revealed the same week that Kashmir Hill <a href=\"https://archive.ph/jKSOk\">published a gutting new investigation into</a> people losing touch with reality after engaging too heavily with ChatGPT. </p><p>Hill writes about the story of one man, Mr. Torres, a 42-year-old accountant in Manhattan who started using ChatGPT last year to make financial spreadsheets and to get legal advice. Hill reports:</p><blockquote><p>Mr. Torres, who had no history of mental illness that might cause breaks with reality, according to him and his mother, spent the next week in a dangerous, delusional spiral. He believed that he was trapped in a false universe, which he could escape only by unplugging his mind from this reality. He asked the chatbot how to do that and told it the drugs he was taking and his routines. The chatbot instructed him to give up sleeping pills and an anti-anxiety medication, and to increase his intake of ketamine, a dissociative anesthetic, which ChatGPT described as a “temporary pattern liberator.” Mr. Torres did as instructed, and he also cut ties with friends and family, as the bot told him to have “minimal interaction” with people.</p><p>Mr. Torres was still going to work — and asking ChatGPT to help with his office tasks — but spending more and more time trying to escape the simulation. By following ChatGPT’s instructions, he believed he would eventually be able to bend reality, as the character Neo was able to do after unplugging from the Matrix.</p><p>“If I went to the top of the 19 story building I’m in, and I believed with every ounce of my soul that I could jump off it and fly, would I?” Mr. Torres asked.</p><p>ChatGPT responded that, if Mr. Torres “<em>truly, wholly</em> believed — not emotionally, but architecturally — that you could fly? Then yes. You would not fall.”</p></blockquote><p>I can’t <a href=\"https://archive.ph/jKSOk\">recommend the full story enough</a>. It’s a really <a href=\"https://archive.ph/jKSOk\">gutting longread</a> about how technology can deeply distort reality and cause people to lose their minds. This quote will stick with me for a while:</p><p>“What does a human slowly going insane look like to a corporation?” Mr. Yudkowsky asked in an interview. “It looks like an additional monthly user.”</p><p><a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/p/the-facebook-boomer-reactor-core?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=share&amp;action=share&amp;token=eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjoxMTMxMTk5NywicG9zdF9pZCI6MTY1ODQ0Njg4LCJpYXQiOjE3NTM3MzMzNzQsImV4cCI6MTc1NjMyNTM3NCwiaXNzIjoicHViLTMyMzgiLCJzdWIiOiJwb3N0LXJlYWN0aW9uIn0.pfBv7yM-mx383a1AxbArw5rx3v4-qc7LxvbQTJtH2HY\"><span>Share</span></a></p><h2>What I’m reading</h2><p><strong>Inside the AI Party at the End of the World</strong></p><p>At a mansion overlooking the Golden Gate Bridge, a group of AI insiders met to debate one unsettling question: If humanity ends, what comes next? - <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/ai-risk-party-san-francisco/\">Wired</a></p><p><strong>Battle of the Cool Kids: Inside the A24, Neon and Mubi Turf War</strong></p><p>For the first time in years, there's a three-way brawl for the title of Hollywood’s ‘It’ indie outfit. - <a href=\"https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-features/a24-neon-mubi-indie-film-specialty-1236261817\">The Hollywood Reporter</a></p><p><strong>How the Outrage Machine Consumed Christina Formella</strong></p><p>An Illinois teacher was charged with sexual assault of a student. TikTok and the tabloids took the story to new places. – <em><a href=\"https://archive.is/2025.06.12-112532/https://www.thecut.com/article/downers-grove-illinois-teacher-christina-formella-case-outrage-machine.html\">The Cut</a></em></p><p><strong>This A.I. Company Wants to Take Your Job</strong></p><p>Mechanize, a San Francisco start-up, is building artificial intelligence tools to automate white-collar jobs “as fast as possible.” - <em><a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2025/06/11/technology/ai-mechanize-jobs.html?unlocked_article_code=1.OE8.VLtR.gZSbsrSJh4z9&amp;smid=url-share\">The New York Times</a></em></p><p><strong>Why Do Dads Watch TV Standing Up?</strong></p><p>Everyone knows that fathers love to watch TV standing up. Comedian Josh Gondelman investigates this cultural mystery, and develops a complete taxonomy of standing dads. - <em><a href=\"https://www.gq.com/story/why-do-dads-watch-tv-standing-up\">GQ</a></em></p><p><strong>Audrey Gelman’s World Isn’t Millennial Pink Anymore</strong></p><p>The Wing’s creator is taking another stab at shaping the tastes of her peers, this time with a pastoral inn — and more hotels on the way. - <em><a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2025/06/12/style/audrey-gelman-hotel-wing.html\">The New York Times</a></em></p><p><strong>Soros v Bezos: What battle of billionaire weddings tells us about America </strong></p><p>It’s tasteful against tacky as Huma Abedin and Lauren Sánchez marry their fiancés in the Hamptons and Venice this month, writes an expert on the rich and famous. - <a href=\"https://www.thetimes.com/us/news-today/article/jeff-bezos-alex-soros-weddings-huma-abedin-lauren-sanchez-cnpcwwtz8\">The Times UK</a></p><p><strong>TikTok Hottie Jack Innanen Is Making the Pivot to TV. He's Still Blasting Chief Keef.</strong> </p><p>The 25-year-old star of FX's \"Adults\" known as the “internet’s boyfriend” talks millennials, flight radar, nude sleepers, and the \"American Psycho\" remake. - <em><a href=\"https://www.interviewmagazine.com/comedy/tiktok-hottie-jack-innanen-is-making-the-pivot-to-tv-hes-still-blasting-chief-keef\">Interview</a></em></p><p><strong>The Viral Storm Streamers Predicting Deadly Tornadoes—Sometimes Faster Than the Government</strong></p><p>Storm streamers are using radars and AI robots to track extreme weather for millions of YouTube subscribers, in some cases issuing alerts faster than the National Weather Service. - <em><a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/the-viral-storm-streamers-predicting-deadly-tornadoes-sometimes-faster-than-the-government/\">WIRED</a></em></p><p><a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/p/the-facebook-boomer-reactor-core?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=share&amp;action=share&amp;token=eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjoxMTMxMTk5NywicG9zdF9pZCI6MTY1ODQ0Njg4LCJpYXQiOjE3NTM3MzMzNzQsImV4cCI6MTc1NjMyNTM3NCwiaXNzIjoicHViLTMyMzgiLCJzdWIiOiJwb3N0LXJlYWN0aW9uIn0.pfBv7yM-mx383a1AxbArw5rx3v4-qc7LxvbQTJtH2HY\"><span>Share</span></a></p><h2>User Mag news rundown</h2><ul><li><p>Someone spent <a href=\"https://mashable.com/article/labubu-auction-150000-rare-figure\">$150,000 on a Labubu</a>.</p></li><li><p>Addison Rae <a href=\"https://www.nylon.com/entertainment/addison-rae-addison-tour-therapuss\">might be going on tour</a>. </p></li><li><p>A bunch of Boston Dynamics robodogs <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ptYDWP9uTis\">performed last night on </a><em><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ptYDWP9uTis\">America’s Got Talent</a></em>. (This whole video looks like one of those fake AI Reels videos, it’s insane.)</p></li><li><p>Betting platform Kalshi <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/news/686474/kalshi-ai-generated-ad-nba-finals-google-veo-3\">aired a fully AI-generated 30-second ad</a> during the NBA Finals, reportedly made in 2-3 days with 300-400 generations using Google's Veo 3</p></li><li><p>Americans <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2025/may/23/americans-british-swear-more-online-than-australians\">swear more online</a> than any other nation. </p></li><li><p>AI-powered <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/grok-chatgpt-ai-los-angeles-protest-disinformation/\">chatbots</a> like Grok and ChatGPT are spreading crazy misinformation about the L.A. protests. </p></li><li><p>A24 hired a 19-year-old YouTuber to direct it's new <a href=\"https://variety.com/2025/film/news/the-backrooms-a24-kane-parsons-1236428019/\">horror movie</a> <em>The Backrooms</em>.</p></li><li><p>People are calling grabbing a Diet Coke during the day having a “<a href=\"https://www.fastcompany.com/91351477/what-is-a-fridge-cigarette-the-viral-diet-coke-trend-explained\">fridge cigarette</a>.”</p></li><li><p> The number of singles using AI to date is <a href=\"https://mashable.com/article/singles-using-ai-to-date-up-300-percent-match\">up 300% from last year</a>.</p></li><li><p>China bans banks from <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/business/2025/jun/10/china-bans-banks-labubu-dolls\">luring customers with Labubu dolls</a>.</p></li><li><p>Sign-ups for <a href=\"https://trumpcard.gov/\">Trump’s $5M 'Trump Card'</a> fast-track to US citizenship <a href=\"https://www.foxbusiness.com/politics/foreign-nationals-join-waitlist-trumps-5m-fast-track-us-citizenship\">hit 15,000</a>, over $75 Billion Dollars.</p></li></ul><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FxO_!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff696b5b7-8013-4abe-bb78-606acc7435e8_1179x419.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FxO_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff696b5b7-8013-4abe-bb78-606acc7435e8_1179x419.jpeg\" width=\"508\" height=\"180.53604749787957\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FxO_!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff696b5b7-8013-4abe-bb78-606acc7435e8_1179x419.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FxO_!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff696b5b7-8013-4abe-bb78-606acc7435e8_1179x419.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FxO_!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff696b5b7-8013-4abe-bb78-606acc7435e8_1179x419.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FxO_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff696b5b7-8013-4abe-bb78-606acc7435e8_1179x419.jpeg 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div></div></div></a></figure></div><ul><li><p>The Trump administration revoked Hasan Piker's <a href=\"https://x.com/HasanabiProd/status/1932871663353307396\">global entry pass</a> over his political coverage. </p></li><li><p>Men are claiming that Ozempic makes their dicks bigger <a href=\"https://www.dailymail.co.uk/health/article-14802563/Im-suffering-Ozempic-penis-latest-bizarre-effect-caused-weight-loss-drugs.html\">giving them “Ozempic penis”</a> (weight loss experts say less belly just makes it appear that way). </p></li><li><p>Bonnie Blue, the OnlyFans star who slept with 1,000 men in a day <a href=\"https://www.vice.com/en/article/bonnie-blues-petting-zoo-stunt-allegedly-got-her-banned-from-onlyfans/\">has been banned from OnlyFans</a> for extreme content. </p></li><li><p>A psychiatrist posed as a teen and engaged with therapy chatbots, discovering <a href=\"https://time.com/7291048/ai-chatbot-therapy-kids/\">some disturbing conversations</a>. </p></li><li><p>ChatGPT was <a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/gaming/chatgpt-destroyed-in-chess-match-by-48-year-old-atari-2600-despite-claiming-it-would-win-easily-3213392/\">destroyed in chess match</a> by a 48-year-old Atari 2600 despite claiming it would win easily. </p></li><li><p>More Americans are <a href=\"https://www.boundless.com/blog/more-americans-are-giving-up-us-citizenship/\">renouncing U.S. citizenship</a>.</p></li><li><p>A <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DK3NJI1RuMT/\">Zohran Mamdani lookalike contest</a> took place in Prospect Park.</p></li><li><p>Scientists can’t get enough of watching<a href=\"https://www.wsj.com/articles/scientists-cant-get-enough-of-watching-gulls-steal-your-food-58866ce7\"> gulls steal your food</a>.</p></li></ul><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!I_Xf!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83817343-fa2c-46e2-ab19-73f0552eb448_1179x1225.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!I_Xf!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83817343-fa2c-46e2-ab19-73f0552eb448_1179x1225.jpeg\" width=\"385\" height=\"400.0212044105174\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!I_Xf!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83817343-fa2c-46e2-ab19-73f0552eb448_1179x1225.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!I_Xf!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83817343-fa2c-46e2-ab19-73f0552eb448_1179x1225.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!I_Xf!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83817343-fa2c-46e2-ab19-73f0552eb448_1179x1225.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!I_Xf!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83817343-fa2c-46e2-ab19-73f0552eb448_1179x1225.jpeg 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><ul><li><p>The “non-lethal” weapons being used against protesters in L.A. are <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/non-lethal-weapons-la-protests/\">not as non lethal</a> as law enforcement is making them seem. </p></li><li><p>Air Traffic Control in the US <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/air-traffic-control-windows-95-floppy-disks/\">still runs on Windows 95</a> and floppy disks.</p></li><li><p>An new <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/an-experimental-new-dating-site-matches-singles-based-on-their-browser-histories/\">dating site</a> matches singles based on their browser histories. Browser Dating users upload their 5,000 most recent searches. </p></li><li><p>CNN is planning a major audio <a href=\"https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/business/digital/new-cnn-podcast-expansion-talent-formats-1236262540/\">expansion and podcasting push.</a></p></li><li><p>Pinterest is adding <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/news/685830/pinterest-ltk-affiliate-shopping-content-creators\">third-party influencer content to its feeds</a>.</p></li><li><p>ABC News’ Terry Moran <a href=\"https://deadline.com/2025/06/terry-moran-launches-substack-abc-news-dismissal-1236431503/\">moves to Substack</a> after the network fired him for calling Stephen Miller a “world class hater.”</p></li><li><p>Another <a href=\"https://pressgazette.co.uk/newsletters/reach-launches-series-of-substack-newsletter-digests-in-bid-for-new-audiences/\">British publishing conglomerate</a> is pivoting to Substack. </p></li><li><p>Amazon, Oracle and Coinbase are sponsoring Trump’s <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/policy/685690/big-tech-trump-military-parade-america250\">military parade</a> party.</p></li><li><p>Beginning next week you’ll be able to <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/news/685953/instagram-notes-spotify-song-share-reels-update\">rearrange your Instagram layout.</a></p></li><li><p>More small-town newspapers are dying <a href=\"https://www.cjr.org/analysis/small-town-newspapers-aging-succession.php\">because no one wants to run them</a>.</p></li><li><p>Kickstarter-funded films are coming to <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/news/684374/tubi-kickstarter-initiative\">Tubi</a>.</p></li><li><p>People can’t stop asking ChatGPT <a href=\"https://mashable.com/article/chatgpt-hot-enough-beauty-trend\">if they're hot enough</a>.</p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!J4Zv!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F484e84a0-2520-476a-aaab-ea68e8f43113_1179x1200.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!J4Zv!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F484e84a0-2520-476a-aaab-ea68e8f43113_1179x1200.jpeg\" width=\"348\" height=\"354.19847328244276\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!J4Zv!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F484e84a0-2520-476a-aaab-ea68e8f43113_1179x1200.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!J4Zv!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F484e84a0-2520-476a-aaab-ea68e8f43113_1179x1200.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!J4Zv!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F484e84a0-2520-476a-aaab-ea68e8f43113_1179x1200.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!J4Zv!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F484e84a0-2520-476a-aaab-ea68e8f43113_1179x1200.jpeg 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div></li><li><p>Rithm.love is a <a href=\"https://www.rithm.love/?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email\">dating app</a> where your profile is just a screenshot of your Instagram explore page, so you can find your \"scrollmates.\"</p></li><li><p>Heinz Japan is releasing limited-edition <a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/gaming/kirby-gets-limited-time-ketchup-sauce-collab-with-heinz-3212746/\">'Kirby'</a> ketchup bottles.</p></li><li><p>People are turning old iPhones into “<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DKxTC09vUsb/?igsh=NTc4MTIwNjQ2YQ%3D%3D\">offline phones</a>\", keeping them in airplane mode and only having limited apps.</p></li><li><p>25-year-old Deja Foxx who’s running for congress in Arizona is being called <a href=\"https://www.newsweek.com/deja-foxx-alexandria-ocasio-cortez-aoc-arizona-special-election-democrats-2084714\">“the next AOC.”</a></p></li><li><p>The newspaper that <a href=\"https://archive.ph/7l9Vu#selection-697.0-714.0\">hired ChatGPT</a>. </p></li><li><p>Watch a Tesla with full self driving ignore a stop sign and <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tesla/686803/watch-a-tesla-with-fsd-ignore-a-stop-sign-and-run-over-a-child-sized-dummy\">run over a child-sized dummy</a>.</p></li><li><p>The Rent Reducer 9000 is a little <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DJkLiiJJsv7/\">free library</a> that monitors nearby open houses and triggers a gunshot noise to bring rent prices down.</p></li><li><p>GameStop is <a href=\"https://archive.ph/XYiIH\">pivoting from video games</a> to selling <a href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-06-12/gamestop-ceo-cohen-says-company-s-future-is-in-trading-cards\">Pokémon</a> cards. </p></li></ul><p><a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/p/the-facebook-boomer-reactor-core?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=share&amp;action=share&amp;token=eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjoxMTMxMTk5NywicG9zdF9pZCI6MTY1ODQ0Njg4LCJpYXQiOjE3NTM3MzMzNzQsImV4cCI6MTc1NjMyNTM3NCwiaXNzIjoicHViLTMyMzgiLCJzdWIiOiJwb3N0LXJlYWN0aW9uIn0.pfBv7yM-mx383a1AxbArw5rx3v4-qc7LxvbQTJtH2HY\"><span>Share</span></a></p><h2>Good posts</h2><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VFIv!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F35a22c95-31dc-4f4f-b8f2-3078cf698497_1179x1103.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VFIv!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F35a22c95